Thanks, everybody, for
coming along to what

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.670
is otherwise a cloud
conference to hear a little bit

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.000
about Android.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.100
Do you all hear me
OK, first of all?

